# Ripgrep & LLM search tool ignore rules
# These patterns keep massive data files out of search results, preventing context-window blowout.

# Massive lyrics audit JSON dumps (e.g. 6.5MB estamos-arriba.json)
app/lyrics-audit/data/*.json

# Large research outputs, embeddings, and models
research/**/results/
**/*.jsonl
**/*.npz
**/*.joblib

# Scratch and log artifacts
*.log

# Large generated app data (read targeted keys, never search these)
app/conjugation/data/
app/cognates/*/cognates.json
app/data/merge-exceptions/
app/data/speech-frequency/
app/data/source_titles.json
*dev_changelog.json

# History: not a source of open work
docs/archive/
scripts/archive/
